findings.remediation:
Add an `image_scanning_configuration` block with `scan_on_push = true`:
```hcl
image_scanning_configuration {
  scan_on_push = true
}
```

Replace the `null_resource` with a dedicated CI/CD pipeline step (e.g., GitHub Actions, CodeBuild) for building and pushing images. If Terraform must manage this, use the `kreuzwerker/docker` Terraform provider which handles authentication and image pushing natively without shell injection risk:
```hcl
resource "docker_registry_image" "app" {
  name = local.docker_image
  build {
    context = "${path.module}/resources"
  }
}
```
